; Tool Table for Lathe
; T — tool number, P — pocket, X/Z — offsets, D — diameter, I — front angle, J — back angle, Q — orientation
;
; Orientation (Q):
;   1=front-right  2=front-left  3=rear-left  4=rear-right
;   5=right        6=top         7=left        8=bottom       9=center
;
T1  P1  X+0.0000 Z+0.0000 D0.0000 I0 J0 Q1 ;Turning tool
T2  P2  X+0.0000 Z+0.0000 D0.0000 I0 J0 Q2 ;Boring bar
T3  P3  X+0.0000 Z+0.0000 D0.0000 I0 J0 Q1 ;Facing tool
T4  P4  X+0.0000 Z+0.0000 D0.0000 I0 J0 Q1 ;Threading tool
T5  P5  X+0.0000 Z+0.0000 D0.0000 I0 J0 Q9 ;Parting tool
T6  P6  X+0.0000 Z+0.0000 D0.0000 I0 J0 Q9 ;Center drill
